2026-10-13T11:15:31.6793699Z Run the POSIX AIO store benchmark.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6793868Z 
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6793937Z options:
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6794167Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6794496Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6794849Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6795176Z                         concurrently.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6795822Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6796157Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6796535Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6796914Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6797261Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6797644Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6797990Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6798335Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6798788Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6799120Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6799694Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6800061Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6800434Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6800791Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6801133Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6801484Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6801788Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6802106Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6802521Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6802912Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6803253Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6803597Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6803927Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6804160Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6804448Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6804773Z                         block_size).
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6805025Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6805321Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6805706Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6806026Z                         layers).
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6806256Z   --block-size BLOCK_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6806531Z                         vLLM paged block size in tokens; used to derive
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6806867Z                         block_number from input-len.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6807234Z   --kv-dtype KV_DTYPE   override KV dtype: bfloat16/bf16, float16/fp16,
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6807637Z                         float32/fp32, float8_e4m3fn/fp8, float8_e5m2, int8.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6808005Z                         Default: config torch_dtype or bfloat16.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6808377Z   --posix-data-trans-concurrency POSIX_DATA_TRANS_CONCURRENCY
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6808781Z                         posix data transfer concurrency (psync worker count).
