2026-10-13T11:15:31.6809731Z   --posix-io-engine {psync,aio}
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6810023Z                         posix io engine: psync or aio. Default aio.
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6810331Z   --io-direct, --no-io-direct
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6810641Z                         use O_DIRECT for aligned file I/O (default true; --no-
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6810996Z                         io-direct to disable).
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6811349Z   --dry-run             print the computed profile and the forwarded command
2026-10-13T11:15:31.6811714Z                         without launching the script.
